<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL E SETS RIGHTS RECORD DATE.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL E SETS RIGHTS RECORD DATE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading firm Mostostal Export SA set June 24, 1996 as the record date of its planned one-for-50 rights issue at one zloty per share, Mostostal said in a short version of its issue prospectus.</p>
<p>The issue consists of 900,000 shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders will be able to register for shares in two subscription periods scheduled for February 24-March 17 and for April 7-21.  </p>
<p>Mostostal Export now has 45 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
